@api = http://localhost:5100
@email = student@example.test
@password = Test123!Safe
@token = PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE

### Health
GET {{api}}/health

### Register (choose a new email if already registered)
POST {{api}}/user/Register
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"{{email}}","password":"{{password}}","firstName":"Student","lastName":"NorthWind"}

### Sign in and copy accessToken into @token
POST {{api}}/user/Login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"{{email}}","password":"{{password}}"}

### Available products
GET {{api}}/catalog/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Duplicate product: must return 400
POST {{api}}/CreateOrder
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{"customerId":"ALFKI","shipAddress":"Main Street 123","shipCity":"Quito","shipCountry":"Ecuador","shipPostalCode":"170101","orderDetails":[{"productId":1,"unitPrice":35,"quantity":1},{"productId":1,"unitPrice":35,"quantity":2}]}

### Special order: configured SMTP or local pickup notification
POST {{api}}/CreateOrder
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{"customerId":"ALFKI","shipAddress":"Main Street 123","shipCity":"Quito","shipCountry":"Ecuador","shipPostalCode":null,"orderDetails":[{"productId":1,"unitPrice":35,"quantity":1},{"productId":3,"unitPrice":65,"quantity":1},{"productId":4,"unitPrice":75,"quantity":1},{"productId":5,"unitPrice":50,"quantity":1}]}

### Customer with debt: must return 400
POST {{api}}/CreateOrder
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{"customerId":"ANTON","shipAddress":"Main Street 123","shipCity":"Quito","shipCountry":"Ecuador","shipPostalCode":null,"orderDetails":[{"productId":1,"unitPrice":35,"quantity":1}]}

### Missing token: must return 401
POST {{api}}/CreateOrder
Content-Type: application/json

{"customerId":"ALFKI","shipAddress":"Main Street 123","shipCity":"Quito","shipCountry":"Ecuador","shipPostalCode":null,"orderDetails":[{"productId":1,"unitPrice":35,"quantity":1}]}

### Paginated lookup by ID or name
GET {{api}}/catalog/products/search?query=Chai&page=1&pageSize=5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Saved invoice: replace 1 with the created order ID
GET {{api}}/orders/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Invoice PDF
GET {{api}}/orders/1/invoice.pdf
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
